@startuml
title JoySong GitHub CI/CD and Alibaba Cloud UAT

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Developer
actor "UAT Reviewer" as Reviewer

rectangle GitHub {
  component "Pull Request\nquality gates" as CI
  component "UAT tag\nDraft Release" as Release
  component "Acceptance Issue" as Issue
  component "Promote / Rollback" as Control
}

cloud "Alibaba Cloud" {
  component "OIDC RAM Role" as OIDC
  storage "Private release OSS" as ReleaseOss
  component "Cloud Assistant" as Assistant

  node "Existing ECS\n(UAT Candidate -> UAT)" as ECS {
    component "existing joysong-demo\n(frozen only at final cutover)" as OldBackend
    component "root dispatcher" as Dispatcher
    component "joysong-deploy" as DeployUser
    component "Nginx\nHTTPS / persistent maintenance" as Nginx
    component "joysong-uat\nSpring Boot" as Backend
    folder "releases/<tag>\ncurrent / previous" as Releases
    folder "root-only backup identity\nconfig / DB / data" as Backups
    file "persistent transaction marker" as Marker
    database "Isolated MySQL\nmyapp_worktree_*" as UatDb
    folder "Persistent public/private files" as Files
  }
}

Developer --> CI
CI --> Release : full gates pass
Release --> OIDC : short-lived credentials
OIDC --> ReleaseOss : upload immutable bundle
OIDC --> Assistant : RunCommand on tagged ECS
Assistant --> Dispatcher : env + release + manifest SHA
Dispatcher --> DeployUser : fixed allowlisted operation
DeployUser --> ReleaseOss : short-lived download
DeployUser --> Releases : verify and stage
Dispatcher --> Backups : capture before mutation
Dispatcher --> Marker : fail closed during switch
Marker --> Nginx : 503 until verified
Marker --> Backend : block reboot/startup
OldBackend --> UatDb : current writer before cutover
Dispatcher --> OldBackend : bind identity, freeze, verify stopped
Releases --> Backend : atomic current switch
Releases --> Nginx : Admin static root
Backend --> UatDb
Backend --> Files
Nginx --> Backend

Release --> Issue : create after technical checks
Reviewer --> Issue : record business acceptance
Issue --> Control : accepted or rejected
Control --> Release : Draft -> Pre-release
Control --> Dispatcher : manual rollback

note right of ECS
  UAT and future Prod use isolated
  users, ports, directories, secrets,
  databases and release links.
end note

note bottom of Control
  Prod remains disabled until both
  GitHub variable and root sentinel
  are enabled and all blockers clear.
end note

@enduml
